window.products.push({"id":486134,"name":"TEABOCO All-in-One Reusable Boba Cup/Smoothie Tumbler - 24oz BPA FREE Bottle with Leak Proof Lid, Silicone Sleeve and Two Metal Straws for Water, Juic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JpqLrIuzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"~DESIGNED WITH CONVENIENCE IN MIND~ The Teaboco tumbler is light and sturdy, making it perfect for all your on-the-go beverage needs! It fits in standard cup holders, is dishwasher and microwave safe, is easy to clean and comes with 2 straws with different widths. We thought everything through to elevate your favourite drink! ~MULTI-FUNCTIONAL~ Some days you crave boba tea, and other days coffee. That’s why our glass tumbler has a unique and ingenious lid with a leak-proof hole that perfectly fits a wide straw for boba pearls, as well as an equally splash-proof sip opening to make drinking your morning cup of coffee a breeze. 24 ounces effortlessly fits an iced Starbucks Venti or a large boba tea / smoothie at your favorite shop. ~SLEEK AND STYLISH~ This hand-blown glass water tumbler cup will get friends and strangers alike turning their heads. Our premium borosilicate glass material and beautiful silicone sleeve makes the Teaboco tumbler your portable go-to everyday mug. Fill it up with your creative beverage creations and you’re on your way. ~INSPIRED BY THE OCEAN, CREATED FOR YOU~ Our eco friendly mug means you can say ‘sayonara’ to all single-use straws, lids, tumblers, bottles or cups. No more choosing between your hydration or the planet. A portion of proceeds will be donated to an ocean conservation organization because every action counts. ~100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE~ Even though we’re sure you’ll LOVE the Teaboco Tumbler, if you have any concerns, rest assured that we have a secure money-back guarantee and full refund in place. We are committed to providing quality products to all our customers- and that includes you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JpqLrIuzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEABOCO","source_asin":"B089T5C6PH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089T5C6PH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089T5C6PH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
