window.products.push({"id":486147,"name":"Longquan Porcelain Tea Thermos Double Wall High Vacuum Insulated Chinese Teaware (white, blue, landscape)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2FzIrnLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tea thermos from Longquan province with a glass lid and a beautiful pictures with a distinct Asian flavor. Travel tea cup features a porcelain body, smooth surface, double walls with air gap & steady bottom. Our motto is 'Good fit (our thermoses are compact), safe (materials are eco friendly and food grade) and handy (oodles of great features including double walls)'. And our thermoses are eye candy with an Asian flavour as well! Our reusable tea thermoses make excellent replacements for many single use plastic water bottles and plastic caps. Keep your favorite drink hot or cold and stop worrying about spilling! Each thermos mug holds a volume of about 11.4 fl oz/300 ml. The empty cup weighs approx. 22 oz /625 g Buy with сonfidenсe! Our teaware has 100% 30 days money baсk guarantee. You also get exсlusive warranty against defeсts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d2FzIrnLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Tea","source_asin":"B01MSPFWCT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSPFWCT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSPFWCT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486148,"name":"European Embroidered Sheer Curtains 63 Inch 2 Panels Rod Pocket Voile Curtains White Sheer Europe Floral Tulle Window Drapes for Living Room/Bedroom(5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819pIaRPtOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE SPECIFICATIONS: 2 panels european embroidered sheer curtains per set. Each panel measures: 52\"W x 63\"L(for a total width of 104\"). 2.5'' high rod pocket can accommodate a 1.5'' diameter window rod, which can be easily install and slide on standard or decorative curtain rods. PREMIUM MATERIAL: White sheer curtains are made of high quality and durable polyester fabric, which have high performance in drape and decoration. Its texture is smooth and soft, lightweight and breathable, not easily deformed. Each panel is crafted in good workmanship, will create you a comfortable and warm atmosphere. EUROPEAN EMBROIDERED PATTERN: Classic and elegant floral embroidered pattern, add a touch of modern and bohemian style to your room. Unlike ordinary sheers, european embroidered patterns makes curtains more draped and aesthetic. Perfect for home decoration in modern, vintage and casual styles. WIDE APPLICATION: Living room curtains can filter sunlight and ultraviolet rays, balance indoor and outdoor light levels, and provide you with enough privacy. Sheer curtains are finished with a pole/rod pocket construction, simply move the rod pocket back and forth to adjust to your preferred level of privacy and sunlight. USE AND MAINTENANCE: These rod pocket curtains are machine washable, no bleaching, Low temperature ironing. Sheer white curtains 2 panels can be used as decorations for bedrooms, living rooms, kids’ room, nursery, kitchen, cafe and other occasions, as well as high-quality gifts for friends, relatives, and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819pIaRPtOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLEUM CADE","source_asin":"B095CD4M7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095CD4M7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095CD4M7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
