window.products.push({"id":486276,"name":"Bread Proofing Basket Set – Round 9” Brotform Banneton with Linen Couche Liner and Bakers Scraper Lame for Homemade Sourdough and Artisan Ciabatta – H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4m-3H-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bake a masterpiece Create mouthwatering artisan breads with crackly crusts and eye-catching scoring patterns with the Wikkz 9-Inch Bread Proofing Basket Set. By helping loaves maintain their structure through their final rise, this essential sourdough banneton basket lets you bake flawless artisan bread every time. This premium banneton comes with a high-quality linen couche cloth and a stainless steel dough scraper that doubles as a bread lame for scoring dough. Showcase your baking skills Handcrafted from the highest-grade natural rattan cane, this graceful bread bowl with inner diameter of 8.4\" helps foster the ideal micro-climate during proofing so that your dough forms a superb crust during baking. The Wikkz Proofing Basket can be used without the couche cloth for the familiar spiral pattern of expensive bakery loaves; or it can be used with the couche cloth to absorb some moisture from dough so that scoring is clean and easy. Durable and easy to use Cleaning your cane banneton calls for simply allowing any dough remnants to dry out for 1-2 days so that they can be flaked-away. Your Wikkz Linen Couche needs only mild hand-washing and air-drying, while your rust-proof dough scraper with silicone handle is dishwasher-safe. Your brotform proofing basket is food-grade, non-toxic and BPA-free but it should never be placed into the oven. To successfully launch your breadmaking endeavors, our instruction manual includes one of our favorite bread recipes. For gorgeous boule loaves that look like they came from a bakery, add the Wikkz Sourdough Proofing Basket to your bread making tools today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4m-3H-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wikkz","source_asin":"B08CYB56PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CYB56PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CYB56PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
