window.products.push({"id":486321,"name":"TJ Global Red and Black Melamine Japanese Long Handle Spoons for Ramen, Soup, Hot Pot Eating, Mixing, Stirring 8.25 Inches (4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MjXcQ63xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL AND TRADITIONAL: Japanese tableware is considered an art form as it sets the tone of the overall dining experience. Our traditional Japanese ramen spoons will help you create a natural and authentic Japanese dining atmosphere as well as a genuine traditional Asian dining experience. With these beautiful large soup spoons, the combination of delicious food and aesthetic Japanese tableware compliment each other perfectly MANY USES: Designed to enhance the dining experience of Asian-inspired foods; they are not only great for Ramen but also for Hot Pot, Pho, Noodles, Udon, Curry or any Soup or Asian meals. They are not only for Asian foods though, they can be used for cereals, oatmeal, and anything else you eat with a spoon! Also makes scooping your delicious food out of the hotpot much easier and since its melamine you won't have to worry about burning your fingers with traditional metal hot pot spoons. LARGE SIZE: Our large Japanese spoons have 8.25\" long handles with a 2.5\" in diameter spoon. You never have to worry about having to fish your spoon out of a bowl of soup again! Perfect for even the biggest bowls of soup or noodles! Features a sleek glossy appearance with a hexagonal detail on the back of the spoon. Front is red and back is black EXTRA DURABLE: Say goodbye to broken dishes! Our Ramen spoons are made from food grade MELAMINE which is much harder to break and is guaranteed to last you a long time and dishwasher safe. PERFECT GIFT: Choose from a pack of 2, 3 or 4 spoons. With its lovely traditional design, these spoons are a perfect present for friends, family or co-workers, and Ramen connoisseurs! Gift this to any Ramen or Hot Pot lover in your life or any other Asian food lover so they can eat their delicious noodle soups at home! Pair with our large ramen bowls for the best authentic Asian food experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MjXcQ63xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TJ Global","source_asin":"B07ZTTBWJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZTTBWJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZTTBWJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
