window.products.push({"id":486328,"name":"Non-Stick Gas Sandwich Toaster, Take Our Toaster And Make a Delicious For Your Family With Own Hands, Compatible Hand ( Black )., 4x16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bip72uaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ Gas toaster is very helpful for every kitchen. Simply turn on your gas and make crispy sandwich for breakfast, evening snacks or for dinner .✔ The Gas Toaster has benefit that it is Nonstick, so it needs no or less oil and gives you healthy and low calorie food. You can easy clean it once you are done using it.✔ The nonstick inner coating should be used on toasting blades. You don’t want sandwich sides to stick while you take it out. However, even nonstick ones toast best when you drizzle some butter/oil on both.✔ A toaster seals the edges and keeps the filling inside. This isn’t possible if you grill in a skillet. You will likely have pieces of the mixture (fillings) falling off each bite. The gas toaster should have a curvy center so that edges can be pressed together without spillage.✔ This manual tool will prepare delicious sandwiches in no time. This is an excellent option for quick snacks, whether you are a small family or a large family.✔ it must be strong –it will be used over direct heat, so it should be solid. The paint should also not peel off.✔ You will love the Gas Toaster, which is a very easy-to-use, durable, robust, and affordable gadget.✔ Package contents - 1 Unit Nonstick Gas Sandwich Toaster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618bip72uaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B1D45XJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1D45XJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1D45XJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
