window.products.push({"id":486440,"name":"GRANDDECO Spring Flowery Tulip Table Runner, Embroiderd Cutwork Floral Dresser Scarf for Home Kitchen Dining Room Easter Holiday Tabletop Decoration (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xa4lNnjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why use table linens.A dining table is incomplete without a table topper,it can keep your table clean and also decorate your table .This graceful table linen have a embroidered Flower and delicate Hand-Cut-Work make it more beautiful and possess a vivid spring atmosphere. The table linens have different sizes and styles .You can choose the size in line with your demand.We create and inspire them for modern living.We try my best to meet your needs from various aspects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xa4lNnjZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRANDDECO","source_asin":"B0851BDH86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0851BDH86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0851BDH86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486441,"name":"Decor Wonderland Frameless Square Beveled Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hCeGWoG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Decor Wonderland Frameless Square Beveled Rectangle Wall Mirror will add visual interest and eye-catching design to your living space. With its polished, updated design, the mirror can be used in any room of your house or apartment. From entryways to half baths, this versatile accent mirror reflects light and creates an illusion of space, enhancing your room and making it appear larger. To add depth and dimension, add multiple mirrors in your hallway, entryway, or foyer. Crafted of thick, strong 3/16\" glass and metal, the wall mirror features a bevel design. The polished,square mirror edges give off a classic feel. A double-coated silver backing eliminates reflection distortion, so there's no funhouse effect when you're checking your hair or applying make-up. This double coating also helps prevent corrosion in high humid spaces, like bathrooms. For easy hanging, there are 3 brackets affixed to the back of the mirror. Choose your preferred orientation to determine which 2 brackets to use. With the included invisible mounting hardware, you can skip a trip to the store. Everything is included to hang this double orientation mirror. The invisible mounting hardware secures the mirror to the wall, while keeping it flush against the wall and the hardware out of sight. Whether you hang the mirror horizontally or vertically, you should measure your space to make sure the accent mirror will fit your space. Update your space at a fraction of the cost, this wall mirror is a large step up from the contractor's basic mirror. Perfect for residential use, the 1\" bevel frameless mirror can also be used in retail shops, offices, and other commercial spaces. The accent mirror measures 23.5\" W x 0.5\" D x 31.5\" H, weighs 17 lbs., and is easy to clean with a damp cloth and water or window cleaner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hCeGWoG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decor Wonderland","source_asin":"B00T9AITS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T9AITS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T9AITS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
