window.products.push({"id":486590,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Ashley Basket, Classic Kitchen Design for Breads, Roll, Muffin, Pastries & Baked Good Storage, Traditional Style Snack & Food Hol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJUBIt-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fresh, beautifully baked bread deserves to be served in style. Enter Spectrum Diversified’s Ashley Bread Basket. Show off your show-stopping loaves and rolls in a basket adorned with elegant craftmanship. Whether you’ve created perfect rolls or a stunning loaf, bring it to the table in a basket as beautiful as the bake. The open wire design keeps the basket lightweight, helping you carry the serving dish from kitchen to dining room table and back. The classic design fits any décor with an enduring, timeless style. The elegant style casts a sense of luxurious charm and grace that characterizes classic taste. Refined, grand, and sophisticated, this organizer will exude style in your kitchen. Line basket with a cloth or napkin to contain crumbs. After everyone has enjoyed their bread, simply throw the cloth into the washing machine. Crumbs will not get stuck in the open-wire design, making it easy to clean up after dinner. Perfect for any baked good, or use it to display fruits and vegetables on your countertop. This versatile basket can also help you organize snacks in the pantry. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJUBIt-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B00JSPSDIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JSPSDIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JSPSDIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486591,"name":"(4pk) 16 inch Collapsible Mesh Food Cover Tent Umbrella Set with Storage Bag - Reusable Covers Protect from Flies and Bugs - Best Net Protector for Ou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711y6iE07pL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","description":"What are flies good for? Besides transferring diseases, not a whole lot. But every time you have a get-together outside and food is involved, they decide to crash the party. And they are the rudest guests you can imagine, touching every food item you have on the table, and who knows where those feet have been? Chances are those feet just got done walking through all your trash, or better yet, walking all over that little “present” your pet left you on the lawn. It goes without saying that you probably don’t want those feet on your food, but how in the world can you get them to stay away? That’s where our collapsible food tents come in. The mesh material allows your guests not only to see what food is inside but easily access it, all while our gross little party crashers are stuck watching from the outside. The design allows for easy set up (just pull up the string) and easy take down, without any assembly necessary. The tents serve as great functional décor, both keeping insects out while adding an elegant touch to any event. They are a great gift for anybody and can be used at any number of events: weddings, barbeques, picnics, family reunions, etc. Your fly problem can be eliminated with a click of a button, so push “Add to Cart” right now and keep out the party crashers from your next event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711y6iE07pL._AC_SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oaklyn","source_asin":"B01HPMFEOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HPMFEOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HPMFEOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
