window.products.push({"id":486718,"name":"VANRA Expandable Drawer Organizer for Silverware Utensils Holder Adjustable Cutlery Tray Drawer Dividers for Flatware, Kitchen Knives (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b7Gu-r0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VANRA Utensils Tray Kitchen Flatware Drawer Organizer Cutlery Tray Holder for Silverware: VANRA cutlery tray fit beautifully into most kitchen drawers with different sizes. Silverware organizer perfect for neatly containing a variety of small kitchen items. Save space of counter and drawer. It’s recommended to measure the silverware tray for drawer first before purchasing. It fits in bigger drawers and adjusts well with the expandability. The expandable side allows you to put long cutting knives or long kitchen tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b7Gu-r0kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANRA","source_asin":"B08ZYHN9B8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYHN9B8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYHN9B8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486719,"name":"Candle Holder Agate Stone (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x-bSWvP7S._SL1080_.jpg","description":"Place these agate candle holders anywhere in your home to immediately harness the ancient power of crystals in a new, modern, functional way. Whether you are looking to enhance your interior design with some from-the-earth natural decorations, or you wish to purify your environment from negative energy, this agate candle holder is a beautiful, eye-catching addition to any room of the house. When you purchase an agate candle holder, whether it’s for yourself or as a gift, you are receiving a one-of-a-kind piece of art. The artist? Mother Nature. Since ancient times, agate stones have been recognized for their incredible power and strength. This is literal and figurative; Agate is physically a strong stone used in the breastplates of Greek warriors headed to battle, but it also has grounded, foundational gentle vibrations that connect you to the strength and wisdom of the earth itself. In ancient China, agate was believed to purify the mind and energize chi, your vital life force. In Medieval Europe, agate was valued for promoting good harvest and calming harsh weather. Nowadays, primarily when used as home decoration, agate energizes internal healing, allowing you to reflect on your true foundations and balance your energy accordingly. This agate candle holder decorative stone compliments any home decoration: even contemporary designers are starting to accent their modern interiors with natural materials. And, with the spiritual and physical properties of agate, this candle holder is the best of both worlds. It lasts a lifetime and also contributes beneficially to your life and energy. The versatility of this stone decoration is endless- no matter where you place this agate candle holder, it adds uniqueness and positive energy to your home without effort. This is the perfect gift on any occasion or recipient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x-bSWvP7S._SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artisansmx","source_asin":"B099C3CKB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099C3CKB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099C3CKB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486720,"name":"COSORI Electric Kettle Temperature Control with 6 Presets, 60min Keep Warm 1.7L Electric Tea Kettle & Hot Water Boiler, 304 Stainless Steel Filter, Au","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G42phhPuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Hard Water -Hard water is a kind of water that contains calcium or magnesium mineral ions that often in the form of carbonate -These ions do not pose any health threat, but they can engage in reactions that leave insoluble mineral deposits. How to Descale/Clean the Kettle? 1. Filling the kettle with 1 cup of vinegar or lemon juice and 2 cups of water.andnbsp; 2. Boiling the liquid and leave it for 2 hours, then use a cloth to clean and wipe.andnbsp; 3. Rinse the kettle with clean water, and dry with a soft, clean cloth.andnbsp; 4. Repeat as needed. Notes: 1. It's normal if your kettle exposes spots or rust on the stainless steel bottom after the first use if the water quality in your area is so hard. 2. When you choose a preset with Keep Warm Mode on,  and then lift the kettle during heating; the CO117-DK will continue the heating process if the kettle is returned to the base within 1 minute.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G42phhPuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSORI","source_asin":"B0BKNR6M1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKNR6M1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKNR6M1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
