window.products.push({"id":486754,"name":"All-Clad BD55500 D5 Brushed 18/10 Stainless Steel 5-Ply Bonded Dishwasher Safe Dutch Oven with Domed Lid Cookware, 5.5-Quart, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H7JXlrBrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Dutch Oven, or what the French call une cocotte, is probably the most competent cookware piece in the kitchen. It’s deep enough to braise, stew, or slow cook from the stovetop to the oven. As part of our D5 Stainless Collection, this Saucepan is made with our patented process that bonds 3 layers of stainless steel with 2 layers of aluminum. It distributes heat more evenly and slowly, eliminating hotspots, so your food doesn’t stick or burn. For an added touch of style, it has a timeless brushed finish that adds a bit of texture and refinement to your kitchen and is easier to clean. At 3 quarts in size, it’s just right for making sauces, heating liquids, cooking food in liquids and reheating. To keep your All-Clad looking brand new, we recommend washing your cookware with a soap and sponge instead of the dishwasher. Like all our bonded cookware, it's handmade in the USA at our Canonsburg, PA factory with ultra-durable materials that'll last a lifetime and never go out of style. Handles & handle loops are made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H7JXlrBrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B0051OEST4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0051OEST4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0051OEST4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486755,"name":"ASENTE 4 Ultra Bright LED Crystal Display Stand with White LED Light - Lighted Display Base Perfect for 3D Laser Etched Crystal Glass Pictures, Acryli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M-PrVgO+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHOWCASE YOUR FAVORITES: Make your favorite glass, crystal art, or acrylic pieces and figures stand out with our LED display base. This lighted display base with 4 LED lights will make your glass art pieces, acrylic collectibles, or action figures look great in any setting. The LED lights shine and create more dimension when viewing your collectibles, so you will have a more vibrant, eye-catching display. EXCELLENT CRAFTSMANSHIP AND DESIGN: Our LED light base for crystal glass art and figures features a sleek design that can complement and highlight your favorite piece. These bright 4 LED lights will not change color or twinkle, so you can create a stunning display whether it's on top of your desk or inside a glass display case. Our light base features a classy brushed silver colored base. DISPLAY YOUR WAY: Light up and display your favorite piece anywhere with our LED stand. Our LED light base for crystal art, collectibles, and figures measures 2.5\" x 2.5\" x 1.5\", making it easy to carry and showcase your favorite ornament anywhere. Our LED stand can also switch between two modes: 1. lights off and 2. lights on. Take our LED base to any trade show or event and watch your collectibles turn heads. VERSATILE POWER SUPPLY: Our LED mirrored display stand can be powered by the included AC/USB Adaptor for continuous use. The quality 4 LED lights on our display base are energy-saving and able to produce up to 10,000 hours of light. Present all the sides of your favorite display piece stunningly with our LED display base. ABOUT US: At Asente Lights, we’re dedicated to providing you with wonderful LED light stands to showcase your art and collectibles. We’re a three-generation family business, and we handle every item we sell to ensure you get durable products. If you ever have a problem with an item you purchased from Asente Lights, let us know and we’ll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M-PrVgO+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASENTE","source_asin":"B0BR98JLJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR98JLJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR98JLJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486756,"name":"MEUNEAR Cow Canvas Wall Art Daisy Teal and Grey Bathroom Decor Wild Animal Western Cattle in Bathtub Pictures for Bedroom Nursery Modern Farmhouse Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"ABOUT MEUNEAR Wall Art: Our store sells a variety of oil paintings in different styles, each carefully crafted by our team of designers. You can also tell us the pattern you want, we have a dedicated team that can process the picture for you and customize it for you. Beautiful things deserve everyone's appreciation, and life itself is a grand art. From now on, decorate your room, decorate your life, and quietly enjoy the surprises and happiness that art brings to us for the rest of our lives. Create beauty, appreciate beauty, become beauty itself! We hope that every product we create can bring an excellent shopping experience to our customers. Features: We use high-definition printing technology to print color pictures on high-quality canvases, then frame them with wooden frames. All four sides are framed with wooden frames and can be easily hung on the wall. Oil paintings are the best choice for decorating a room and are easy to maintain. This fabric can be stored for a long time and is durable. Don't worry about being outdated, the longer the oil painting is stored, the more sense of age and story. This is the meaning of classic immortality. Please boldly choose the style you like. Size: We have 2 sizes for you to choose, normal size: 12x16 inches (30x40 cm), large size: 16x20 inches (40x50 cm) Package includes: 1x Canvas Art Wall + 4x Seamless Studs.  Due to different monitor settings, printing colors may vary slightly. This artwork is handcrafted by us and may vary by 2-3 cm. Hope you can understand!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEUNEAR","source_asin":"B09X1FYZX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1FYZX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1FYZX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
