window.products.push({"id":486856,"name":"1837 Map of Saudi Arabia|Turquie D'Asie, Arabie, Perse|Middle East|Title: Turquie D'Asie, Arabie, Pe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RaFk2X0XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"World Atlas: Turquie D'Asie, Arabie, Perse. Caboul, Beloutchistan et Turkestan. Dressee par C.V. Monin. Paris. Armand Aubree, Editeur, Rue Taranne, 14. Grave sur Acier par L. Grenier, Rue des Noyers, 33. Imprime par Mangeon. Ecrit par Benard, Rue St. Jacques, 51. (1837) | L'Univers. Atlas Classique Et Universel De Geographie Ancienne Et Moderne. Dresse Par M. Monin, Membre de la Societe de geographie, et M. Fremin, Geographe du Depot de la guerre ... Paris. Armand Aubree, Edteur, Rue De Vaugirard, 17. 1837. Uncolored engraved map. Relief shown by hachures. Rivers shown. Accompanies Montemont's Histoire Universellle Des Voyages... Large Folio atlas. Not in Phillips. 1st page of ancient maps lacking. We can find no record of this atlas, other than the Sabin reference and the Oceanie map in Tooley Aust. Monin and Fremin did a smaller world atlas, offered by Hudson in 1988. These maps are large and impressive. They were published with Montemont's 46 volume History of Voyages, although Sabin calls for an Atlas of 22 maps, whereas this has 38 maps on 36 sheets. Maps are without color and bound in quarter leather brown marbled paper covered boards with \"Atlas De L'Histoire Des Voyages\" stamped in gold on the spine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RaFk2X0XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New York Map Company LLC","source_asin":"B07P3VMBJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P3VMBJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P3VMBJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
