window.products.push({"id":486940,"name":"Small Dehumidifiers for Home, Grentay 30oz(850ml) Room Dehumidifiers Safe Auto-Off, Quiet & Portable Dehumidifiers with LED Indicator for Basement Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5109LLElDHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"➤【2021 New Upgraded & High Quality】 Adopted Peltier technology(no compressor needed), this small dehumidifier with 850ml large water tank can remove up to 300ml of water per day at 86℉(30℃), 80% RH. High-quality material, durable and great decoration for your home. ➤【Energy-saving & Low Noise】Rated power 22.5W means only consuming 0.54 kWh after running for 24 hours, which is eco-friendly and saves electricity bills for you. The dehumidifiers for home damp produce about 36 dB noise when it runs, allowing it quiet to run all day and night. ➤【Auto Shut-off & LED Indicator】This bathroom dehumidifier will automatically shut off when the water tank reaches full, and then the LED indicator turns flicking. This mini humidifier is suitable for an area less than 20㎡ (215 sq.ft), such as basements, bedroom, bathroom, garage, wardrobe, RV. ➤【Easy Operation & Detachable to Wash】One button operation allows this dehumidifier for bedroom to be used easily by everyone. The water tank can be detached to pour water and wash. With a compact size of 5.5x5.5x11.8inch(14x14x30cm) and weight 2.76 lb(1.25kg), easy to carry and move. ➤【Remove Damp & Improve Air Quality】Grentay mini dehumidifier is an ideal solution for absorbing humidity without chemical substances. It helps purify the air and reduces excessive moisture to improves the air quality. If you have any questions, pls feel free to contact our 7*24hours customer service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5109LLElDHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grentay","source_asin":"B08VJ9JT1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ9JT1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ9JT1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":486941,"name":"Heartful Diamonds Diamond Painting Kits for Adults Galaxy Butterfly – 40x50cm (16x20 in) – 5D Round Partial Drill Art – Birthday, Anniversary, Christm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DSKTvb6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Heartful Diamonds, we have used only the highest quality materials to ensure your Diamond Painting experience is a class above any competitor on the market. When you buy your diamond paintings with us on Amazon, enjoy: ✔️ Laser cut resin drills with the lowest defect rates in the industry. ✔️ Ultra clear canvas with bold-print, easy to read symbols. ✔️ 99.99% confidence that there are no missing drills/diamonds with your kit. ✔️ Durable and fibrous canvas material to ensure easy straightening and no creases. With every kit, we ensure you have everything you need to work on your next crafts masterpiece. Here's what's inside your beautiful packaging: 1 x Full Size, Color-Coded Canvas with a fully workable pasting area. 1 x Full Size, Color-Coded Canvas with a fully workable pasting area. 11 x Different Vibrant Colored 'Diamond' Beads and Jewels. 11 x Different Vibrant Colored 'Diamond' Beads and Jewels. 1 x Hollow Stylus to pick up Diamonds. 1 x Hollow Stylus to pick up Diamonds. 1 x Wax Pad to stick Diamonds on the Canvas. 1 x Wax Pad to stick Diamonds on the Canvas. 1 x Premium Ridged Tray with Funnel, to Pour, Keep and Separate Diamonds. 1 x Premium Ridged Tray with Funnel, to Pour, Keep and Separate Diamonds. Detailed specifications: Size: 40 x 50cm (16x20 in) Size: 40 x 50cm (16x20 in) Coverage: Partial Drill Coverage: Partial Drill Diamond Style: Shiny Round + Special Diamond Style: Shiny Round + Special Q. What does \"Partial Drill\" mean?A. The resin 'diamonds' are also called 'drills', and so 'Partial Drill' simply indicates that some portion of the picture is pre-colored background. This gives the finished project a \"5D\" Effect. The other type is 'Full Drill', which means that the entire canvas is workable. Q. What is a Round Diamond style?A. The two main types of diamonds are Round and Square. Round diamonds are much easier to place accurately for beginners, but will still result in a more relaxing and enjoyable experience no matter your skill level with diamond painting. The resulting picture looks more glossy for Square type, and more shimmery for Round due to the way the resin is cut.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DSKTvb6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heartful Diamonds","source_asin":"B07MNK82HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-486941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MNK82HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MNK82HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
